Site Director — third-party attributions
========================================

This skill bundles, quotes, and indexes material from third parties. The MIT
license in LICENSE covers this project's own code and prose. It does NOT
relicense anything below. Each item keeps its own terms.


1. UI/UX Pro Max  (data redistributed)
--------------------------------------
`references/design-elements.json` contains rows derived from the UI/UX Pro Max
skill's CSV corpus — 161 colour-token rows (`data/colors.csv`) and 73 font
pairings (`data/typography.csv`), carried over with their original field values.

    Project: ui-ux-pro-max-skill
    Author:  NextLevelBuilder
    Source:  https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
    Home:    https://uupm.cc
    License: MIT

MIT permits redistribution with attribution; this notice is that attribution.
Every affected entry in design-elements.json also carries
`"source": "UI/UX Pro Max"` inline, and `sources["UI/UX Pro Max"].license`
records the same. Regenerate the file from your own install with
`node scripts/build-design-elements.mjs`.


