3. Reference pack sources  (distilled, cited)
---------------------------------------------
`reference-pack/*.md` distils publicly published trend, colour, and typography
reporting into original summaries. Each file cites its sources inline. Notable
upstreams include Lounge Lizard, Davey & Krista, Pantone, Wix, Webflow, Muzli,
Typewolf, and Fonts In Use. No article text is reproduced wholesale.


4. Google Stitch  (integration target)
--------------------------------------
`connectors/google-stitch-connector.mjs` integrates with Google Stitch via the
Stitch MCP server. Google Stitch is a Google product; this project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Google.

NOTE: the connector declares the endpoint `https://stitch.googleapis.com/v1/prototypes`
with the placeholder key `YOUR_API_KEY` because the skill's contract names it.
No public Google Stitch REST API is known to exist and that endpoint has not
been observed to respond. The working transport is MCP. See README § Connector.
